  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Missing Persons - Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to ensure an effective, sustainable, multilateral, rule-of-law-based cooperation mechanism &#x2013; Missing Persons Group &#x2013; to account for persons missing from armed conflicts in the former Yugoslavia, where men comprise the larger proportion of the missing, led by the domestic institutions for missing persons of Bosnia and Herzegovina, Croatia, Kosovo, Montenegro and Serbia, in which &#x2013; primarily women - among families of the missing are actively engaged.</narrative>
  </description>
